ne-dot">·</span> <time datetime="2026-11-07T09:02:14+00:00">November 7, 2026</time> <span class="byline-dot">·</span> <span>11 min read</span> </span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="entry-content post-content article-content dynamic-entry-content itgw-prose"> <p class="ym-go-disclosure">iTechGuides is reader-supported. When you buy through links on our site, we may earn an affiliate commission. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. <a href="https://www.itechguides.com/affiliate-disclosure/">Learn more</a></p><p>The <strong>Anker Soundcore Space Q45 Wireless</strong> is the strongest all-round choice among these budget over-ear wireless headphones if you want effective noise cancelling for commuting or travel. For a cheaper option with a longer tested battery, choose the <strong>Anker Soundcore Life Q20 2024</strong>; for sturdier hinges, the <strong>CMF Headphone Pro</strong>; and for lower latency with video or mobile games, the <strong>Razer Opus X Wireless</strong>. The <strong>EarFun Wave Pro</strong> is another travel-focused value pick. This guide treats budget as under $150 MSRP, uses U.S. coverage published in 2026, and does not claim that sale prices or stock were verified on Nov. 7, 2026.</p> <h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="At_a_glance"></span>At a glance<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Name</th> <th>Best for</th> <th>Key spec</th> <th>Checked</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Anker Soundcore Space Q45 Wireless</td> <td>Overall budget ANC and travel isolation</td> <td>28 hours of battery in RTINGS testing</td> <td>Nov 2026</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Anker Soundcore Life Q20 2024</td> <td>Low-cost value and battery life</td> <td>49 hours of battery in RTINGS testing</td> <td>Nov 2026</td> </tr> <tr> <td>CMF Headphone Pro</td> <td>Durability-focused budget ANC</td> <td>Stainless-steel hinges; 46 hours of battery in RTINGS testing</td> <td>Nov 2026</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Razer Opus X Wireless</td> <td>Low-latency video and mobile gaming</td> <td>68 hours of battery in RTINGS testing</td> <td>Nov 2026</td> </tr> <tr> <td>EarFun Wave Pro</td> <td>Travel value</td> <td>ANC and LDAC; $79.99 MSRP reported by SoundGuys in 2026</td> <td>Nov 2026</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>The comparison reflects 2026 coverage, not a live retailer price or inventory check on Nov. 7, 2026. The under-$150 limit is a working MSRP definition; sale prices change, and the available coverage does not establish a current U.S. checkout price for each model. RTINGS’ current budget ANC guide provides the first four role-based picks, while SoundGuys names the EarFun Wave Pro for travel.</p> <div class="yorker-top ym-aawp-phase2-top"> <div class="aawp"> <table class="aawp-table"> <thead> <tr> <th class="aawp-table__th-position">#</th> <th class="aawp-table__th-thumb">Preview</th> <th class="aawp-table__th-title">Product</th> <th class="aawp-table__th-pricing">Price</th> <th class="aawp-table__th-links"></th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr class="aawp-product aawp-product--ribbon aawp-product--sale aawp-product--bestseller" > <td class="aawp-table__td-position">1</td> <td class="aawp-table__td-thumb"> <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/0857197681?tag=itechguides04-20&#038;linkCode=ogi&#038;th=1&#038;psc=1&#038;keywords=personal+finance+books" title="The Psychology of Money: Timeless lessons on wealth, greed, and happiness"> </a> </td> <td class="aawp-table__td-title"> <a class="aawp-product__title" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/0857197681?tag=itechguides04-20&#038;linkCode=ogi&#038;th=1&#038;psc=1&#038;keywords=personal+finance+books" title="The Psychology of Money: Timeless lessons on wealth, greed, and happiness" >The Psychology of Money: Timeless lessons on wealth, greed, and happiness </a> </td> <td class="aawp-table__td-pricing"> <span class="aawp-product__price">&#36;10.99</span> </td> <td class="aawp-table__td-links"> <a class="aawp-button aawp-button--buy aawp-button aawp-button--amazon a